  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Papoutsakia means little shoes in Greek. The aubergine halves are pre-roasted before filling so they stay firm under the sauce. Do not skip this step or the shells go soggy."}]
      },
      {
